      "prompt": "Why does the woman suggest a larger fan?",
      "promptZh": "女子為什麼提議使用較大的風扇？",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "It can maintain airflow at a lower speed.",
          "zh": "它能以較低轉速維持風量。",
          "whyZh": "女子說大風扇能以較低速度提供同樣風量，因此值得測試其降噪效果；對話尚未宣稱測試已通過。"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "It requires no connector.",
          "zh": "它不需要連接器。",
          "whyZh": "男子明說連接器不同，需要轉接器。"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "It will eliminate the need for cooling.",
          "zh": "它會讓設備不再需要散熱。",
          "whyZh": "風扇仍是散熱方式，並未取消散熱需求。"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "It has already passed every test.",
          "zh": "它已通過所有測試。",
          "whyZh": "女子說要測試這顆風扇，聲學測試室也尚待預約。"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "explanationZh": "女子說大風扇能以較低速度提供同樣風量，因此值得測試其降噪效果；對話尚未宣稱測試已通過。",
      "evidence": "It can move the same amount of air at a lower speed.",
      "vocabulary": [
        {
          "term": "airflow",
          "zh": "風量；空氣流動",
          "note": "此處指風扇所提供的冷卻氣流。"
        }
      ],
      "revision": 1
    }
  ],
  "oldGroupId": "t01-g039",
  "newGroup": {
    "id": "t01-g039-r2",
    "testId": "test-01",
    "part": 3,
    "title": "Repeating a heat test",
    "titleZh": "重做散熱測試",
    "topic": "technology",
    "passage": "Man: I was about to report seventy degrees, but the cover wasn't quite shut. The probe cable was caught under it.\nWoman: Leave that reading out of the comparison. We have to test with the cover fully closed. I've got a thinner cable that will fit the opening.\nMan: What about the replacement fan? Supplier A can deliver this afternoon, but not before our two o'clock test. Supplier D's sample is here, but it came without the clips we need.\nWoman: Supplier B's sample is at the receiving desk, and the clips are in the box. Let's test that one. I'll collect it. Can you mark the first reading as invalid? Leave the worksheet open so we can add the new reading after the test.",
    "passageZh": "男：我本來要回報七十度，才發現上蓋沒有完全關好。探頭的線卡在上蓋下面了。\n女：不要把那筆讀值拿來比較。測試時上蓋必須完全關閉。我手上有一條更細的線，能穿過開孔。\n男：那更換的風扇呢？A 供應商今天下午可以送達，但趕不上我們兩點的測試。D 供應商的樣品已到了，但缺少需要的卡扣。\n女：B 供應商的樣品在收貨處，卡扣也在盒裡。我們測那一台吧，我會去領。可以請你把第一筆讀值標成無效嗎？工作表先不要關，測完後我們再加入新的讀值。",
    "audioScript": "I was about to report seventy degrees, but the cover wasn't quite shut. The probe cable was caught under it.\nLeave that reading out of the comparison. We have to test with the cover fully closed. I've got a thinner cable that will fit the opening.\nWhat about the replacement fan? Supplier A can deliver this afternoon, but not before our two o'clock test. Supplier D's sample is here, but it came without the clips we need.\nSupplier B's sample is at the receiving desk, and the clips are in the box. Let's test that one. I'll collect it. Can you mark the first reading as invalid? Leave the worksheet open so we can add the new reading after the test.",
    "turns": [
      {
        "voice": "male",
        "text": "I was about to report seventy degrees, but the cover wasn't quite shut. The probe cable was caught under it."
      },
      {
        "voice": "female",
        "text": "Leave that reading out of the comparison. We have to test with the cover fully closed. I've got a thinner cable that will fit the opening."
      },
      {
        "voice": "male",
        "text": "What about the replacement fan? Supplier A can deliver this afternoon, but not before our two o'clock test. Supplier D's sample is here, but it came without the clips we need."
      },
      {
        "voice": "female",
        "text": "Supplier B's sample is at the receiving desk, and the clips are in the box. Let's test that one. I'll collect it. Can you mark the first reading as invalid? Leave the worksheet open so we can add the new reading after the test."
      }
    ],
